    "name": "Sky: Ascendant (Capricorn)",
    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>♑ Capricorn is ascendant today.</strong> Your Cloth is awake. For the whole day your Techniques heighten as though you were <strong>4 levels higher</strong>, and you have your Ascendant Boon.</p><p>Your unarmed Strikes <strong>ignore all resistances, physical immunities, and Hardness</strong>, and gain +1 damage die.</p><p>On a critical hit you may <strong>sever</strong> a limb, a sense, or a natural attack until the target receives <em>regenerate</em>. You Strike incorporeal creatures and force effects normally, and a critical hit destroys a force effect outright.</p><hr /><p><strong>GM:</strong> seed something resistant today, or this boon is a shrug. Capricorn is a key, not a hammer.</p><hr /><p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-class-features.Item.Ascendant Constellation]. Applied and removed by the module's sky tracker; a GM can also drag it on by hand.</p>"
        },
